								Posts: 642<br />
								<br />
								<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;"><img src="http://farm2.static.flickr.com/1223/869447584_6f40b9af0f_s.jpg" width="65" height="65" alt="" border="0" /></div><br />
								
								
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=the%2Bolaf&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/aim.gif" alt="the+olaf" border="0" /></a>
								<br />
								<a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?action=profile;u=30"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="http://www.myspace.com/schoolofdissent" title="School of Dissent" target="_blank"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
							</div>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=17.msg106#msg106"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=17.msg106#msg106">Boots' latest blog</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> October 04, 2006, 09:29:44 pm &#187;</div></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">Boot&#039;s latest blog on myspace got me pretty exicited. What are all your thoughts?<br /><br />-------------------------------------<br />Saturday, September 30, 2006<br />&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br />A Few Thangs<br />Current mood: working<br /><br />Tom Morello (from Rage Against The Machine and Audioslave) and I have formed a band called &quot;Street Sweeper&quot;. He&#039;s making all the music, I&#039;m writing all the lyrics and doing the vocals. Music is almost done, we&#039;ll be completely finished soon. More to be announced later.<br /><br />Me and Mr. FAB (for those familiar with the Hyphy Movement, &#039;nuff said) will be doing an album together.<br /><br />The Coup will be touring again, this time with Mr. Lif, from November 23rd to December 20th, stay tuned for cities and dates.<br /><br />This is a little ways off, but we have been confirmed for The Roots&#039; Feb/March U.S. Tour. Hit Questlove&#039;s myspace page and thank him for me. <a href="http&#58;//www.myspace.com/questlove" target="_blank">http://www.myspace.com/questlove</a><br /><br />I&#039;m trying to make some more headway on The Instigators album with me, M-1, and Stic from dead prez. These two are a couple of my really good friends, but we&#039;re all doing so much that it seems our schedules will never sync up. Hit stic.man up and tell him how much you wanna see this project. <a href="http&#58;//www.myspace.com/sticman_deadprez" target="_blank">http://www.myspace.com/sticman_deadprez</a><br /><br />We&#039;ll be starting work on Silk E&#039;s album this week. If you haven&#039;t seen her performing live with us, you can hear her on &quot;BabyLet&#039;sHaveABabyBeforeBushDoSomethin&#039;Crazy&quot; and &quot;Laugh/Love/Fuck&quot; on Pick A Bigger Weapon, or &quot;Sleepwalkin&#039;&quot; on Martin Luther&#039;s album. She&#039;s like a young Tina Turner. Rumour has it that Epitaph is trying to sign her too. Hit up Epitaph president Andy Kaulkin and tell him to give her a shitload of money. <a href="http&#58;//www.myspace.com/andykaulkin" target="_blank">http://www.myspace.com/andykaulkin</a> .<br />Hit up Silk E and say hi: <a href="http&#58;//www.myspace.com/silke1" target="_blank">http://www.myspace.com/silke1</a><br /><br />I&#039;m in a zone, I&#039;ve already started workin on The Coup&#039;s new album, it won&#039;t be so long between albums this time.<br /><br />Peace!<br />Boots<br /><br />P.S.<br />The Coup is nominated for &quot;Best Hip-Hop Group Of The Year&quot; with the BARS (Bay Area Rap Scene) Awards.<br /><br />For those who don&#039;t know- This is a VERY big media event here in the Bay Area, which has a national impact because of all the current hype around here, and we need all the publicity we can get. I think it will be broadcast live on TV this year.<br /><br />The voting is done on the internet, you do not have to be from the Bay Area to vote.<br />There is only one vote per category allowed per computer.<br />So if you&#039;re going to vote more than once it has to be from a different computer.<br /><br />Please Vote Now. Soon it will be too late<br /><br />Go to <a href="http&#58;//www.barsawards.com" target="_blank">www.barsawards.com</a>, hit &quot;Vote&quot;, then hit &quot;Secondary Awards&quot;, and vote for us. They have mispelled our name as &quot;The Coupe&quot;, but don&#039;t let that stop you.</div>
